Remote Calendar Retain

This project includes code adapted from Home Assistant Core's remote_calendar
integration, retrieved from the dev branch on 2026-09-12:
https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/dev/homeassistant/components/remote_calendar

Home Assistant Core is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Copyright belongs to the Home Assistant contributors.

Modified files include __init__.py, const.py, coordinator.py, config_flow.py,
manifest.json, and strings.json. Changes add a separate integration identity,
persistent event retention, configuration editing, and custom integration metadata.

Calendar parsing, HTTP fetching, and calendar entity behavior are derived from
the upstream implementation. Additional files implement retention, translations,
documentation, packaging, and tests for Remote Calendar Retain.
